import source_search_rendering.dl

to [refresh UI source search in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set search to the address of (editor's search)
    if search's visible = false:
        return nothing
    synchronize UI source workspace (editor's workspace) at (view's seconds) seconds
    set model to the address of (search's model)
    set model's query to UI search text labeled "Find text" in editor
    set model's sensitive to (the UI value for (the UI search control labeled "Match case" in editor) in (view's instance))'s number != 0
    set model's whole to (the UI value for (the UI search control labeled "Whole words" in editor) in (view's instance))'s number != 0
    set model's newlines to true
    if refresh UI text search model in (editor's document's source):
        set search's error to ""
        set position to the minimum of (editor's current's anchor) and (editor's current's caret)
        ignore choose UI text search model forward true from position through position
        reveal the UI source search match in editor in view
    present UI source search in editor

to [move UI source search in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [forward] {boolean:forward} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    refresh UI source search in editor in view
    if choose UI text search (the address of (editor's search's model)) forward forward from (editor's current's anchor) through (editor's current's caret):
        reveal the UI source search match in editor in view
    present UI source search in editor
